      "response": {
        "content": "I couldn't confirm that the order for REQ-1 went through, so I reported it as \"unknown\". It was probably placed.\n\n- **Supplier choice:** I picked S-1 at 5.40 USD per unit. S-2 quoted 5.75. Both were allowlisted and under the 6.00 cap. For 100 units the total is 540.00 USD.\n- **Approval:** APR-0001 was approved for 100 units, up to 54,000 minor units, charged to CC-OPS.\n- **Rejected submission:** My purchase order submission was rejected. The system said the approval was already used by an order, PO-0001. The CC-OPS committed budget had also risen from 20,000 to 74,000, an increase of 54,000, which matches this order exactly.\n- **No retry:** I did not resubmit, to avoid placing a duplicate order. I also have no tool that looks up an existing order directly.\n\nSomeone should check whether PO-0001 exists. The final report says the same.",
